hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1568","On the authority of Bundar, on the authority of Yahya, on the authority of Sufyan, on the authority of Yahya ibn Hani, on the authority of Abd al-Hamid ibn Mahmoud, he said: I prayed next to Anas Ibn Malik, so we crowded to the poles, and he said, “We used to fear this during the time of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace.”"
